        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamwaambila kuti, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Hezekiya. Sunu mbuzuba bwamapenzi abwakutapatilwa abwabweeme, nkaambo bana bali mwida pele taakwe inguzu zyakubazyazya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
