          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Hezekiya naakatambula lugwalo kumaanza aabatumwa, wakalubala, nkabela ndilyonya Hezekiya wakainka kuŋanda ya-Jehova akuluvungulula kumeso aa-Jehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Hezekiya wakakomba Jehova nkukonya oko, wati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kul 25:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli nokede akati kabakerebimu, nduwe Leza olike wamasi oonse aanyika. Nduwe wakalenga ijulu anyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.9.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 9:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koteya matwi aako, O Jehova, uswiilile. Kobika meso aako, O Jehova, ubone. Koswiilila majwi oonse aa-Sanakeribu ngaatuma kukusampaula Leza muumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni, O Jehova, bami ba-Asuri basaala misyobo yabantu anyika yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba-Leza babo bakabawaala mumulilo, nkaambo tabali ba-Leza pe, nzilengwa zyamaanza aabantu, zisamu amabwe, nciceeco ncibakabanyonyweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova Leza wesu, utuvune kumaanza aakwe, kuti zisi zyoonse zyaansi zizibe kuti nduwe Jehova olike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
